  "content": "<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Highlight/BH_H_Title.png\">\n<p></p>\n<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Highlight/BH_H_Overview.png\">\n<p></p>\n<center><p>此模组改变了游戏中特定方块的可视化效果，通常这些方块的选择框是轴对齐的，现在它们的选择框变成了倾斜的，以匹配它们的模型，并总体上改善了方块的外观。</p></center>\n<p></p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34ZhTuy.png\">\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://resourceful-bees.gitbook.io/resourceful-lib/highlights\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Highlight/BH_H_Wiki.png\"></a>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/resourcefulbees\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Highlight/BH_H_Discord.png\"></a>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/teamresourceful\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Highlight/BH_H_BisectPromo.png\"></a>",
